{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "500bde1e-3c19-82b2-aacf-2bcef3ea3aa8",
  "created_at": "2025-12-26T15:40:19-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Judith Sherman",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:38:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:39:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, it's Judith Sherman. I'm calling about the catch basin at the corner by me, it's totally clogged with leaves. It's been like that since the weekend and the puddle just never drains."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:39:10-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. Where is this, Judith?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:39:13-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three hundred Ocean Avenue, the Ocean Drive side. And it hasn't even rained, that's what's wicked annoying. It's just sitting there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:39:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So no storm, just a dry-weather backup. How deep is the water?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:39:24-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Up to the hubcaps, easy. Cars are slowing down and throwing it everywhere. I'm calling again about this, honestly, nobody has come out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:39:31-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. I'll put in a request for a crew to clear that basin. Let me read back what I have: three hundred Ocean Avenue, Ocean Drive side, catch basin blocked with leaves, standing water about hubcap deep."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:39:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, that's it. Can you say the part about the crew again? Slowly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:39:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. I'm sending a work request to Public Works to have a crew clear the catch basin at that corner, and we'll call you when it's done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:39:54-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a crew gets sent to clear the basin at the corner, and you call me back when it's done. Got it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:40:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect, that's exactly right. Is the number you're calling from the best one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:40:05-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Use four oh one, five five five, oh one eight two. And please, I'd really like that call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:40:11-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four oh one, five five five, oh one eight two. You'll get one. Have a good afternoon, Judith."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-26T15:40:17-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. You too."
    }
  ],
